{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15111090","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15111090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1511109001:1":{"text":"네가 바로 보칼리스의 영주인가?","source_cn":"你就是呼临城的领主？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD14F9A5919BAA096","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511109002:1":{"text":"겨우 어린아이일 줄이야.","source_cn":"真没想到，居然还是个孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC75053BD62F72A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511109003:0":{"text":"...난 <style=\"highlight\">협상</style>을 하러 온 것이니 적의는 없다.","source_cn":"……我是来<style=highlight>谈判</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BC109F8B813A64A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511109011:0":{"text":"나이는 중요하지 않다! 나... 나는 보칼리스를 대표하는 영주란 말이다!","source_cn":"这和年龄无关，我……我代表呼临城，雅库伯尔的首领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3132CE10E176D44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511109004:1":{"text":"협상은 결국 화해를 구하는 일이다. 겸손한 자세는 네게 이득이 될 뿐, 해가 되지는 않을 것이다.","source_cn":"谈判就是求和。把姿态放低点，这对你只有好处，没有坏处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E72974FCB4EB67E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511109005:1":{"text":"나와 <style=\"highlight\">메인트리 홀</style>에서 이야기를 나누도록 하지. 네 호위병이 무기를 내려놓는다면, 너와 함께 들어가도록 허락하겠다.","source_cn":"跟我去<style=highlight>主树厅</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76F5198817841FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511109006:1":{"text":"무례하군! 왜 이 자리에서 이야기하지 않는 거지? 만약 너희가 우리 영주님을...","source_cn":"放肆！为什么不在这里谈？如果你们把领主——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC84EBE48EF0DD5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511109007:1":{"text":"너희에겐 협상 카드가 없을 텐데.","source_cn":"你们没有谈判的筹码。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FA2CB7D06F19E1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511109008:1":{"text":"받아들이지 못하겠다면 여기서 썩 꺼져라!","source_cn":"如果不接受，那就滚回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x683BD091AE1739D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511109009:0":{"text":"...따르도록 해라.","source_cn":"……按他说的做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B8148EB8D238E59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511